{
  "name": "OpsGuard V3 - Email, Manager Decision and WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OpsGuard V3 setup\n1. Select your existing **Gmail credential** in all five Gmail nodes.\n2. Select your existing **Twilio API credential** in **Send WhatsApp Trial Template**.\n3. Replace the four `REPLACE_WITH_...` values in that HTTP Request node.\n4. Keep this workflow synthetic until production credentials, approved WhatsApp templates, and delivery callbacks are configured.\n\nThe WhatsApp branch continues on error, so it cannot block the email and manager-decision path.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c1978385-cb90-46df-8cd9-561f50e5f118",
      "name": "V3 Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1040, -500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "opsguard-v3-multichannel-test",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
