        "message": "=SYNTHETIC APPROVAL TEST — Clicking a button will not issue a real refund.\n\n{{ $('Receive Synthetic Case Result').item.json.body.case_result.manager_approval_request.decision }}\n\n{{ $('Receive Synthetic Case Result').item.json.body.case_result.manager_approval_request.case_summary }}\n\n{{ $('Receive Synthetic Case Result').item.json.body.case_result.manager_approval_request.replacement_summary }}\n\nAutomatic policy limit: {{ $('Receive Synthetic Case Result').item.json.body.case_result.manager_approval_request.policy_limit }}",
